{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/about/layout,_N_T_/about/page,_N_T_/about"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--lEumuof_GfEtWVTZSjWDG--><html lang=\"en\" class=\"dark __variable_17031a __variable_c2c3d1 __variable_967564\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/0a86735c6520d94f-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/36ef2834916397d3-s.p.ttf\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/ttf\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/49d2f31d75dd11b6-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/91a8d5250c2f2545-s.p.ttf\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/ttf\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/4d447ae7efe7d7c5.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-f47c4580da509d27.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/b39499bc-5a3d39d43e1fe6cb.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/9311-340498c9694e41f2.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-1f3f35e1ff696209.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1859-70651bf18819b8bd.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/about/page-fe3350074504a8a8.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>About · Undate</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"What Undate is, and what it deliberately is not.\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Undate\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Intentional matchmaking for the people who know what they want.\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Undate\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Intentional matchmaking for the people who know what they want.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/undate-logo.png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-ink-900 text-cream-50 font-sans antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16\"><a class=\"text-sm text-cream-50/60 hover:text-cream-50\" href=\"/\">← Undate</a><h1 class=\"mt-10 font-display text-5xl tracking-tight\">About Undate.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream-50/80\">Undate is a premium, intentional matchmaking platform for adults who are tired of swiping. We do not promise more. We promise <em>fewer</em>, better introductions, a small handful, drawn from a curator-reviewed pool of verified members.</p><section class=\"mt-14 space-y-10\"><article><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl tracking-tight\">What we are.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cream-50/75\">A small, deliberately slow product. Onboarding takes time. Matches arrive on a schedule. Conversations are private and unmetricated. Our priority is helping you have a small number of real-life dates with people who could realistically be your partner, not maximising your screen time.</p></article><article><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl tracking-tight\">What we are not.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cream-50/75\">We are not a swipe app. We do not show you the number of people who liked your profile. We do not gamify your loneliness. We do not pretend an algorithm can predict who you&#x27;ll fall in love with, pre-meeting data explains almost none of long-term relationship satisfaction in the research. What our model can do is filter for hard incompatibilities (children plans, life goals, attachment-style traps) so the curator&#x27;s time is well spent.</p></article><article><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl tracking-tight\">Who we are not for.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cream-50/75\">People in a hurry. Users looking for a high volume of casual matches. Anyone under 21. Anyone unwilling to be verified.</p></article></section><section class=\"mt-20 rounded-lg border border-gold-500/30 bg-gold-500/5 p-8\"><p class=\"font-display text-2xl tracking-tight\">Ready to be considered?</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-cream-50/70\">Membership is by invitation. Tell us a little about yourself and we&#x27;ll be in touch.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex gap-3\"><a href=\"/waitlist\"><button class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-sans font-semibold tracking-tight transition-all duration-base ease-spring will-change-transform focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-gold-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-ink-900 active:translate-x-[3px] active:translate-y-[3px] active:shadow-none disabled:opacity-40 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-gold-500 text-white border-2 border-black shadow-retro hover:-translate-x-[2px] hover:-translate-y-[2px] hover:bg-gold-400 hover:shadow-[8px_8px_0_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.85)] h-11 px-6 text-base rounded-full\">Join the Waitlist</button></a><a href=\"/journal\"><button class=\"group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 font-sans font-semibold tracking-tight transition-all duration-base ease-spring will-change-transform focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-gold-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-ink-900 active:translate-x-[3px] active:translate-y-[3px] active:shadow-none disabled:opacity-40 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-transparent text-cream-50 border-2 border-transparent hover:border-gold-500/40 hover:bg-gold-500/10 h-11 px-6 text-base rounded-full\">Read the Journal</button></a></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-f47c4580da509d27.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9278,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[9844,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[1859,[\\\"1859\\\",\\\"static/chunks/1859-70651bf18819b8bd.js\\\",\\\"7220\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/about/page-fe3350074504a8a8.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n9:I[1030,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/0a86735c6520d94f-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/36ef2834916397d3-s.p.ttf\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/ttf\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/49d2f31d75dd11b6-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/91a8d5250c2f2545-s.p.ttf\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/ttf\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/4d447ae7efe7d7c5.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"lEumuof_GfEtWVTZSjWDG\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"about\\\"],\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"about\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[\\\"\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/css/4d447ae7efe7d7c5.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"dark __variable_17031a __variable_c2c3d1 __variable_967564\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"body\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"min-h-screen bg-ink-900 text-cream-50 font-sans antialiased\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"