About Undate.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream-50/80\",\"children\":[\"Undate is a premium, intentional matchmaking platform for adults who are tired of swiping. We do not promise more. We promise \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"fewer\"}],\", better introductions, a small handful, drawn from a curator-reviewed pool of verified members.\"]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-14 space-y-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-2xl tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"What we are.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cream-50/75\",\"children\":\"A small, deliberately slow product. Onboarding takes time. Matches arrive on a schedule. Conversations are private and unmetricated. Our priority is helping you have a small number of real-life dates with people who could realistically be your partner, not maximising your screen time.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-2xl tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"What we are not.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cream-50/75\",\"children\":\"We are not a swipe app. We do not show you the number of people who liked your profile. We do not gamify your loneliness. We do not pretend an algorithm can predict who you'll fall in love with, pre-meeting data explains almost none of long-term relationship satisfaction in the research. What our model can do is filter for hard incompatibilities (children plans, life goals, attachment-style traps) so the curator's time is well spent.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-display text-2xl tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Who we are not for.\"}],\"$L5\"]}]]}],\"$L6\"]}],null,\"$L7\"]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],\"$L8\",false]],\"m\":\"$undefin